354.48 

>  <Bioactivity>
Alprostadil is a Prostaglandin Analog and Prostaglandin E1 Agonist. The mechanism of action of alprostadil is as a Prostaglandin Receptor Agonist. The physiologic effect of alprostadil is by means of Genitourinary Arterial Vasodilation and Venous Vasodilation. The chemical classification of alprostadil is Prostaglandins.

