Tyrosine Kinase/Adaptors

>  <Target>
Src inhibitor;Abl inhibitor;c-Kit inhibitor;EPHA antagonist

>  <Receptor>
Src;Abl, Lck, Yes, Fyn;c-Kit; EPHA 2

