Pramiracetam is a more potent nootropic drug derived from piracetam. Pramiracetam reportedly improved cognitive deficits associated with traumatic brain injuries. Pramiracetam was also effective in the treatment of cognitive disorders of cerebrovascular and traumatic origins.

