C9H14N4O4

>  <MolWt>
242.23 

>  <Bioactivity>
A morpholinyl sydnone imine ethyl ester, having a nitrogen in place of the keto oxygen. It acts as NITRIC OXIDE DONORS and is a vasodilator that has been used in ANGINA PECTORIS.

>  <Pathways>
MAPK Signaling

>  <Target>
NO agonist

>  <Receptor>
NO Donor

