>  <Name>
Flurbiprofen

>  <CAS>
5104-49-4

>  <Formula>
C15H13FO2

>  <MolWt>
244.26 

>  <Bioactivity>
An anti-inflammatory analgesic and antipyretic of the phenylalkynoic acid series. It has been shown to reduce bone resorption in periodontal disease by inhibiting CARBONIC ANHYDRASE.

