>  <Bioactivity>
Deflazacort is a glucocorticoid used as an anti-inflammatory and immunosuppressant.It suppresses the immune system and so it can be used to treat autoimmune diseases. Deflazacort can help to prevent and to treat the rejection of transplanted organs. It can also be used in the treatment of certain types of cancers. 

