Ifenprodil Tartrate

>  <CAS>
23210-58-4

>  <Formula>
C21H27NO2.1/2C4H6O6

>  <MolWt>
475.53 

>  <Bioactivity>
Ifenprodil is an atypical noncompetitive antagonist at the NMDA receptor, it interacts with high affinity at a homogeneous population of NMDA receptors in neonatal rat forebrain.

