>  <Bioactivity>
Simvastatin is an HMGCR (HMG-CoA reductase) inhibitor with anti-proliferative properties. This compound has been shown to modulate purified bovine pituitary 20 S proteasome via mild stimulation of chymotrypsin-like activity and inhibition of peptidylglutamylpeptide hydrolyzing activity. 

